  "steps": [
    "Heat oil, add jeera and let it splutter.",
    "Add garlic, onion and green chillies; sauté till light golden.",
    "Add minced tempeh and cook for 4–5 minutes till aromatic.",
    "Add tomato purée, spices, salt and a little water. Mix well.",
    "Cover and cook for 7–8 minutes till flavours come together.",
    "Finish with garam masala and garnish with coriander.",
